# UI & Animation Overhaul Implementation Plan

The goal of this overhaul is to transition the application from the previous "Organic Tech" aesthetic (Moss Green and Cream) to the new **Official & Actionable** aesthetic based on the provided color palette, and to elevate the Landing Page with smoother, more engaging GSAP animations.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> The new palette swaps out dark mode elements for a much cleaner, more clinical "Soft White" background. This means the Landing Page hero section, which currently uses a very dark forest background, will be shifted to a lighter, more official "Deep Blue" and "Soft White" theme to match the new trusted barangay aesthetic.

